RoY Studio PORTABLE MODE marker.

Because this file is next to RoYStudio.exe, RoY Studio keeps everything inside this folder:
  UserData\   settings, logs, crash reports, plugin list, diagnostic packages
  Projects\   your projects (default save location)
Nothing is written to %APPDATA% or the registry. Deleting the whole folder removes RoY Studio
completely - copy your projects out of Projects\ first if you want to keep them.
Delete this file to use the normal per-user locations instead.
